# RHCSA_RHEL: 9   (this paper reproduces a RHEL 9 EX200 exam; contains containers/set-GID/MBR tasks that RHEL 10 objectives dropped)
# RHCSA two-node exam 04 — auto-composed; single-node tasks unique vs every other exam.
# node1 = graphical workstation (servers + tasks); node2 = headless (clients + tasks).

node1 nfs-export
node1 repo-server
node1 ntp-server
node1 ssh-key-target
node1 hostname-set
node1 firewall-zone
node1 container-logs
node1 at-job
node1 label-mount
node1 network-secondary-ip
node1 list-timers
node1 script-sumloop
node1 setgid-binary
node1 pv-move

node2 root-password   # ALWAYS FIRST on node2 — like the real exam (lost root password, console boot-interruption)
node2 ssh-key-peer
node2 rsync-peer
node2 nfs-mount-peer
node2 autofs-peer
node2 repo-client
node2 ntp-client
node2 find-perm
node2 sudo-group-passwd
node2 container-port-env
node2 package-version
node2 autofs-wildcard
node2 firewall-masquerade
node2 mem-hog-find
